    "detailed_description": "Visit virtually the Konzerthaus Berlin in the heart of Berlin and its halls and learn more about the history in the VR Tour.<br />\r\nThe Konzerthaus Berlin has stood for more than 200 years on perhaps the most beautiful square in the city: the Gendarmenmarkt. This house has experienced a lot: revolutions, wars, destruction, reconstruction. This virtual tour gives you the opportunity to learn more about the history of the house and the halls.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExperience the Konzerthausorchester Berlin with honorary conductor Iv\u00e1n Fischer and choose different positions in the 360\u00b0 orchestra.<br />\r\nThe Konzerthausorchester Berlin plays around 100 concerts per season at the Konzerthaus Berlin. Honorary conductor Iv\u00e1n Fischer gives in this 360\u00b0 concert experience the possibility to sit on different seats and listen to the music in a unique way. You can also take a seat in the middle of the orchestra and listen to the composition as never before.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nComing soon: In the interactive sound world of &quot;Umwelten - Environments&quot; you can discover different plants and creatures, interact with them and thus change the sounds.",
    "about_the_game": "Visit virtually the Konzerthaus Berlin in the heart of Berlin and its halls and learn more about the history in the VR Tour.<br />\r\nThe Konzerthaus Berlin has stood for more than 200 years on perhaps the most beautiful square in the city: the Gendarmenmarkt. This house has experienced a lot: revolutions, wars, destruction, reconstruction. This virtual tour gives you the opportunity to learn more about the history of the house and the halls.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExperience the Konzerthausorchester Berlin with honorary conductor Iv\u00e1n Fischer and choose different positions in the 360\u00b0 orchestra.<br />\r\nThe Konzerthausorchester Berlin plays around 100 concerts per season at the Konzerthaus Berlin. Honorary conductor Iv\u00e1n Fischer gives in this 360\u00b0 concert experience the possibility to sit on different seats and listen to the music in a unique way. You can also take a seat in the middle of the orchestra and listen to the composition as never before.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nComing soon: In the interactive sound world of &quot;Umwelten - Environments&quot; you can discover different plants and creatures, interact with them and thus change the sounds.",
    "short_description": "Welcome to the Konzerthaus Berlin! In two different applications you can explore the house and experience the Konzerthausorchester Berlin. Soon you will also be able to discover new music in a completely new way in the interactive composition &quot;Umwelten - Environments&quot;.",
